<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse suspends Wienerberger on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse suspends Wienerberger on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna stock exchange said on Wednesday it would suspend shares of brick maker Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie from trading on Thursday until 0900 GMT (1100 local).</p>
<p>The company earlier said it would make an &quot;important&quot; announcement concerning a &quot;structural change&quot; in one of its business units at 0700 GMT on Thursday, 30 minutes before the official start of trading on the Vienna stock exchange. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
